What is your data likelihood family?
Which bit of the output are you looking at? The rw1 component itself or the combined posterior distribution?

> Could anyone explain to me why and tell me the formula INLA uses for prediction?

Inla computes (approximations of) conditional distributions in a Bayesian framework, so "prediction" is simply a conditional distribution.

Finn

